Package: yangi-uzbek-harflari
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: xkb-data
Maintainer: nazmiddin255 <https://github.com/nazmiddin255>
Homepage: https://github.com/nazmiddin255/yangi-uzbek-harflari-linux
Description: Yangi o'zbek alifbosi harflari (Ş Ç Ö Ğ) uchun klaviatura
 Oddiy inglizcha klaviatura + o'ng Alt (AltGr) bilan yangi harflar:
 AltGr+S = ş, AltGr+C = ç, AltGr+O = ö, AltGr+G = ğ, AltGr+` = ʼ.
 Ilovalar menyusidagi "Yangi o'zbek harflari" ikonkasi klaviaturani yoqadi.
 Fonda hech qanday dastur ishlamaydi. Rasmiy paket chiqquncha vaqtinchalik yechim.
